  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Osyris lanceolata",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osyris_lanceolata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1370351590,
      "text": "Osyris lanceolata, also known as African sandalwood, watta bush or Camwood, is used for its scented wood and to extract essential oil. The semi-parasitic plant is found from South Africa to Zimbabwe and east Africa, including Tanzania, Kenya and Uganda; northwest Africa; the Canary Islands and the southern half of the Iberian Peninsula. It grows in rocky areas or along the margins of dry forest, but is usually not abundant in any one place."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Osyris lanceolata",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osyris_lanceolata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 174710720,
      "text": "El bayón es un arbusto de la familia de las santaláceas."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Osyris lanceolata",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osyris_lanceolata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 55108699,
      "text": "Osyris lanceolata é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Santalaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Osyris lanceolata",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osyris_lanceolata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 30001217,
      "text": "Osyris lanceolata, yang juga dikenal sebagai cendana Afrika, watta bush atau Camwood, dimanfaatkan karena kayunya yang beraroma dan untuk mengekstraksi minyak atsiri. Tanaman semi-parasit ini ditemukan mulai dari Afrika Selatan hingga Zimbabwe dan Afrika timur, termasuk Tanzania, Kenya, dan Uganda; Afrika barat laut; Kepulauan Canary dan separuh bagian selatan Semenanjung Iberia. Tanaman ini tumbuh di daerah berbatu atau di sepanjang tepian hutan kering, namun biasanya tidak melimpah di satu tempat."
    }
  },
